These witness narrated the steps undertaken by them during the sample proceedings, including disclosing their identity, expressing intention to purchase sample for analysis, lifting the sample of 375 gms of Refined Soyabean Oil (ready for sale)
from DA vs Surinder Kumar Rajput etc sealed tin of 15 kg after opening the same from one side,
shakening the sample commodity in all possible directions several times, dividing the sample commodity into three equal parts in three clean and dry bottles, separately sealing, packing and marking the same and obtaining signatures of vendor and witnesses.
